<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Pohmay debuts at 13.80 rgt.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Pohmay debuts at 13.80 rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysian furniture maker Pohmay Holdings Bhd debuted on the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange on Wednesday at 13.80 ringgit against an offer price of 2.90 ringgit per share.</p>
<p>The company had offered 4.52 million shares for public issue.  </p>
<p>Around 10 minutes after the opening, Pohmay was trading at 13.30 ringgit, with 848 million shares having changed hands.</p>
<p>The company, which makes cane and laminated furniture, is listed on the small-capitalised second board of the exchange.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
